  message: "Fixed in PR #1832 (dev a02f461d2b). Root cause: cuda.py put cuda_execution_space in the id's kind slot, xml_config.py put the AndroidManifest element, and message_dispatch.py built f-string ids ending :message_sender/:message_handler. All three already carried the role on meta. The kind slot is now the kind; node ids change, stable_ids do not. LIVE REPRO on merged dev: hypergumbo run ~/whole_bunch_of_repos/sherpa-onnx gives rc=0 and validation_report id_format violations 72 -> 0. Dispatch stand-ins are now e.g. javascript:wasm/tts/app-tts.js:28-28:sherpa-onnx-tts-progress:function. whisper.cpp (branch run, same code) 1,016 -> 0. Per-producer tests run _check_id_roundtrip on their own output."  # aa3b
